  "description": "Fast, low-allocation HTML5 parser and CSS selector engine for .NET 10 that builds a browser-like DOM from real-world markup: WHATWG tree construction with the adoption agency algorithm, tables, templates, inline SVG/MathML, the full entity table and encoding detection. Compiled and cached selectors with an optional document index, a DOM-free pull parser, async streaming, HtmlLoader for URLs, optional node pooling, and zero third-party dependencies.",
